#: launcher_comment.ulf#writer.LngText.text
#: launcher_comment.ulf%23writer.LngText.text
msgid ""
"Create and edit text and graphics in letters, reports, documents and Web "
"pages by using Writer."
msgstr ""
"Bareessaa fayyadamuun xalayaalee, gabasota, galmeewwanii fi fuulota "
"saphaphuu irratti barruu fi saxxatoo uumi, gulaali."

#: launcher_comment.ulf#impress.LngText.text
#: launcher_comment.ulf%23impress.LngText.text
msgid ""
"Create and edit presentations for slideshows, meeting and Web pages by using "
"Impress."
msgstr ""
"Impress fayyadamuun agarsiisa islaayidiiwwanii, walga'ii fi fuulota "
"saphaphuuf uumi, gulaali."

#: launcher_comment.ulf#draw.LngText.text
#: launcher_comment.ulf%23draw.LngText.text
msgid "Create and edit drawings, flow charts, and logos by using Draw."
msgstr ""
"Fakkii fayyadamuun fakkasaawwan, yaa'insa taattoowwanii fi asxaa uumi, "
"gulaali."

#: launcher_comment.ulf#calc.LngText.text
#: launcher_comment.ulf%23calc.LngText.text
msgid ""
"Perform calculation, analyze information and manage lists in spreadsheets by "
"using Calc."
msgstr ""
"Calc fayyadamuun herrega hojjedhu, odeeffannoo xiinxali, tarreewwan wardii "
"keessaa taligi."

#: launcher_comment.ulf#math.LngText.text
#: launcher_comment.ulf%23math.LngText.text
msgid "Create and edit scientific formulas and equations by using Math."
msgstr ""
"Math fayyadamuun foormulaawwan saayinsaawaa fi himoota qixxaatoo uumi, "
"gulaali."

#: launcher_comment.ulf#base.LngText.text
#: launcher_comment.ulf%23base.LngText.text
msgid ""
"Manage databases, create queries and reports to track and manage your "
"information by using Base."
msgstr ""
"Base fayyadamuun kuusaa deetaa taligi, gaafataa fi gabaasota odeeffannoo kee "
"hordofuu fi taliguuf oolan uumi."

#: launcher_comment.ulf#startcenter.LngText.text
#: launcher_comment.ulf%23startcenter.LngText.text
msgid ""
"The office productivity suite compatible to the open and standardized ODF "
"document format. Supported by Apache OpenOffice."
msgstr ""
"Gartuu sirna offisii gulantaa banaan walsimatee fi ODF fayyadamu. Dokumant "
"Faawundeeshiniin kan deeggaramu."

